# The image runs these directly, so a CRLF checkout on Windows breaks them:
# run.sh is the container CMD and notify.py is exec'd by dsame3 --call, and
# both fail with "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M". Force LF regardless of the
# checking-out platform's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ogg binary
